<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>You've Been Matched – Kwizera Charity Foundation</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f4f4; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background-color: #1a6b3c; padding: 32px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
    .header p { margin: 8px 0 0; color: #a8d5b5; font-size: 14px; }
    .body { padding: 36px 40px; color: #333333; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 15px; }
    .body p { margin: 0 0 16px; }
    .child-card { border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; margin: 24px 0; }
    .child-card img { width: 100%; max-height: 240px; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
    .child-info { padding: 20px 24px; }
    .child-info h2 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 20px; color: #1a6b3c; }
    .child-info .age { display: inline-block; background: #f0f9f4; color: #1a6b3c; border: 1px solid #a8d5b5; border-radius: 20px; padding: 2px 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .child-info p { margin: 0; color: #555555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .steps { background: #f0f9f4; border-left: 4px solid #1a6b3c; padding: 18px 22px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 24px 0; }
    .steps h3 { margin: 0 0 12px; color: #1a6b3c; font-size: 15px; }
    .steps ol { margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; }
    .steps ol li { margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: #444444; }
    .footer { background-color: #f9f9f9; border-top: 1px solid #ececec; padding: 20px 40px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #888888; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Kwizera Charity Foundation</h1>
      <p>A match has been made</p>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Dear <strong>{{sponsorName}}</strong>,</p>
      <p>We are thrilled to share some wonderful news — you have been officially matched with a child through the Kwizera Charity Foundation sponsorship programme. This is a meaningful milestone, and we are grateful for your commitment to changing a young life.</p>

      <div class="child-card">
        <img src="{{childImageUrl}}" alt="Photo of {{childName}}" />
        <div class="child-info">
          <h2>{{childName}}</h2>
          <span class="age">Age {{childAge}}</span>
          <p>{{childBio}}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>Your generosity will help <strong>{{childName}}</strong> access quality education, healthcare, and the support they need to build a brighter future.</p>

      <div class="steps">
        <h3>What happens next</h3>
        <ol>
          <li>Our team will reach out within <strong>3–5 business days</strong> to introduce you and share more details about {{childName}}'s progress and needs.</li>
          <li>You will receive a <strong>first check-in report</strong> within the first month, including updates on school attendance and wellbeing.</li>
          <li>Going forward you will get <strong>monthly updates</strong> on {{childName}}'s milestones, achievements, and how your support is making a difference.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <p>Thank you for choosing to make a difference. You are not just sponsoring a child — you are investing in a future full of possibility.</p>
      <p>With gratitude,<br /><strong>Kwizera Charity Foundation Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      &copy; {{year}} Kwizera Charity Foundation &bull; hello@vnbcoffee.com
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
